---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About Will Finney" description="Will Finney writes Drink Memphis Beer, an independent guide to every Memphis brewery and beer, scored with the Pour Score and the Tap Water Test." pageType="ProfilePage">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-7xl">About Will</h1>
    <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] items-start">
      <picture>
        <source srcset="/images/will/will-backyard-680.webp" type="image/webp" />
        <img src="/images/will/will-backyard-680.jpg" alt="Will Finney, smiling, in a red polo in his Memphis backyard" width="680" height="850" class="w-full rounded-xl object-cover border-4 border-mud" />
      </picture>
      <div class="prose-dmb">
        <p>I'm Will Finney, and this is my hobby: drinking my way through every brewery in Memphis and writing down what I find.</p>
        <p>Every brewery here gets a fair shake. Like everybody, I have a go-to (Wiseacre), and I'd rather tell you that up front than pretend otherwise. Beyond that, every beer has to pass the same test: is it better than a glass of Memphis tap water?</p>
        <p>This site is independent. No brewery pays for a review, and anything sponsored is labeled. See the <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure page</a> for details.</p>
        <p>I edit everything here, and I'm not doing it alone anymore: Memphis writers can pitch stories, profiles and reporting. Meet them on the <a href="/authors/">contributors page</a>, read our <a href="/editorial-standards/">editorial standards</a>, or <a href="/write-for-us/">pitch me a story</a>.</p>
        <p>Find me on <a href="https://x.com/willfinneymem">X (@willfinneymem)</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/will-finney">LinkedIn</a>, or <a href="/contact/">send a tip</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
